# services/

Read [`../../../.agents/skills/frontendStandard/SKILL.md`](../../../.agents/skills/frontendStandard/SKILL.md).

```
services/
  client.ts
  idl.ts
  icp.ts
  <feature>/<feature>.ts
```

- Named exports only
- Use `call()` from `client.ts` — never `HttpAgent` outside `client.ts`
- Components and hooks call services — never inline actor access
- Sync `idl.ts` after actor API changes
